# Borrowing Preview's Meta test app for local WhatsApp E2E over a tunnel.
#
# Development has no Meta app of its own; the test app BELONGS TO PREVIEW
# (webhook + OAuth point at medium-preview.dingu.org). Borrowing it is the one
# sanctioned cross-environment exception (CONTEXT.md "Borrow"):
#
#   1. pnpm tunnel   → note the https://<name>.trycloudflare.com URL
#   2. In the Meta test app dashboard, point the webhook callback URL and the
#      Embedded Signup redirect at the tunnel URL.
#   3. Copy this file to .env.local.dev (git-ignored), fill the test-app
#      values below, and run the dev server with them overriding .env.local.
#   4. When done, POINT THE WEBHOOK BACK at medium-preview.dingu.org —
#      preview's WhatsApp is broken until you do.
#
# META_APP_ID=
# META_APP_SECRET=
# META_SYSTEM_USER_TOKEN=
# META_WEBHOOK_VERIFY_TOKEN=
# META_REDIRECT_URI=https://<name>.trycloudflare.com/api/auth/meta-embedded
# NEXT_PUBLIC_META_APP_ID=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_META_CONFIG_ID=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://<name>.trycloudflare.com
